          <a href="#making-garage-floor-paint-last" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Making Garage Floor Paint Last Longer (If You Choose It)</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. FAQ</a>
